    <model-tier-reason>Single IJobHandler with 3 DAG-parallel sub-handlers (Exchange policies, Graph webhooks, Dataverse service-endpoint webhooks); requires care in T4 action-and-verify semantics but well-specified. Step 3.5.5b sonnet @ high.</model-tier-reason>
