  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">H14 dispatches H14a + H14b + H14c in parallel; each sub-handler implements IJobHandler and registers in L2 DI.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H14a: given 0 policies exist, when it runs, then it creates 2 (BFF app-reg + UAMI).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H14a: given 2 policies exist with matching principals, when it runs, then it verifies + no-ops.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H14a: given 2 policies exist with mismatched principals (T4 drift), when it runs, then it FAILS with a drift-diagnostic message listing expected vs actual AppIds — does NOT silently overwrite.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H14b: creates Graph subscriptions per Communication/Email module using HMAC keys from KV (H4-provisioned); uses Graph v6 with explicit tenantId + catches ODataError.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H14c: registers Dataverse service-endpoint webhooks with correct signing keys.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">S2S consent sub-step (d) is NOT present; startup verification confirms zero references to Dataverse S2S app-reg.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Idempotency: second invocation with same manifestHash is a no-op per sub-handler.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">dotnet build exits 0; dotnet test exits 0; zero analyzer warnings.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Reference: spec.md FR-19 + T4 + r3 task 060 (S2S drop) + Q5 spike (R22 Exchange RBAC deferred to r2).

COMPLETION SUMMARY (2026-08-17): H14IntegrationWiringHandler (parent, HandlerId "H14") + 3 sub-handlers
(H14aExchangePolicySubHandler / H14bGraphWebhookSubHandler / H14cDataverseWebhookSubHandler) implemented under
src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/IntegrationWiring/, registered via a single
AddH14IntegrationWiringHandler() DI extension (IntegrationWiringModule.cs) wired into Program.cs. 4 new seams
(IExchangePolicyApplier, IKvSecretReader [new — reads H4's Communication-Webhook-SigningKey back], IGraphSubscriptionCreator,
IServiceEndpointWebhookRegistrar) each with a production impl + test fakes. New PS script
scripts/Set-ExchangeApplicationAccessPolicy.ps1 implements the T4 action-and-verify sequence with a structured
JSON result contract. 3 documented Path C/A deviations in
projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/notes/task-073-h14-deviations.md (single-writer parent-owns-Cosmos
design to avoid a guaranteed ETag race across Task.WhenAll; run-parameter-supplied Graph resource targets instead
of a hardcoded catalog; Options-configurable Dataverse serviceendpoint option-set values) + 1 new ADR-028 Path A
tension added to spec.md (H14a Exchange PS app-only cert auth — no MI equivalent exists for Exchange Online
Management). 24 new unit tests across 5 test files (H14a/b/c sub-handler tests + parent orchestration tests +
secret-redaction tests). Security hardening applied post-code-review: HMAC secret redaction from HTTP error
diagnostics (defense-in-depth against a theoretical Graph/Dataverse error-response echo) + ILogger added to
DataverseWebApiServiceEndpointWebhookRegistrar for parity. Build 0/0, tests 428/428 (up from 423/423 pre-fix).</notes>

